{"parentUuid":"f5ec9c48-ccab-4095-a508-b996751aced6","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"01171b51-4eaa-47f3-9f5a-15df83a7d2f4","version":"2.1.63","gitBranch":"main","slug":"tender-tickling-aho","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CbvPZYftQDMK9SZkjx1vZ3","type":"tool_result","content":"# DeepWiki Documentation Crawler - GitHub Action Guide\n\n## Action Identification\n**Name:** DeepWiki Documentation Crawler  \n**Owner:** erayack  \n**Path:** `erayack/deepwiki-action@v1`  \n**Repository:** https://github.com/erayack/deepwiki-action\n\n## Core Functionality\nThis action \"automatically crawls and indexes repository documentation on DeepWiki,\" making project documentation searchable and accessible through concurrent processing with configurable retry logic.\n\n## Input Parameters\n\n| Input | Description | Required | Default |\n|-------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| `repository` | Identifier in owner/repo format, GitHub URL, or DeepWiki URL | No | `${{ github.repository }}` |\n| `max_concurrency` | Number of concurrent crawl workers | No | `3` |\n| `request_timeout` | HTTP request timeout in milliseconds | No | `30000` |\n| `retry_attempts` | Number of retry attempts for failed requests | No | `3` |\n\n## Output Parameters\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `repo_exists` | Boolean indicating if repository exists on DeepWiki |\n| `org_repo` | Extracted org/repo identifier |\n| `deepwiki_url` | Generated DeepWiki URL for the repository |\n\n## Example Workflow YAML\n\n```yaml\nname: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\njobs:\n  crawl-deepwiki:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        \n      - name: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n        uses: erayack/deepwiki-action@v1\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ github.repository }}\n          max_concurrency: '3'\n          request_timeout: '30000'\n          retry_attempts: '3'\n```\n\n## Using Outputs\n\n```yaml\n- name: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n  id: deepwiki\n  uses: erayack/deepwiki-action@v1\n\n- name: Check results\n  run: |\n    echo \"Repository exists: ${{ steps.deepwiki.outputs.repo_exists }}\"\n    echo \"DeepWiki URL: ${{ steps.deepwiki.outputs.deepwiki_url }}\"\n```\n\n## Optional Configuration\nSet repository variables for environment-level customization:\n- `MAX_CONCURRENCY` (default: 3)\n- `REQUEST_TIMEOUT` (default: 30000)\n- `RETRY_ATTEMPTS` (default: 3)\n\n## Output Artifacts\n- `deepwiki-content.md` - Raw markdown documentation\n- `index.html` - Formatted HTML documentation with styling"}]},"uuid":"cb10e26f-5618-42ed-b82e-1c318b58a241","timestamp":"2026-03-16T00:33:39.129Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":319916,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# DeepWiki Documentation Crawler - GitHub Action Guide\n\n## Action Identification\n**Name:** DeepWiki Documentation Crawler  \n**Owner:** erayack  \n**Path:** `erayack/deepwiki-action@v1`  \n**Repository:** https://github.com/erayack/deepwiki-action\n\n## Core Functionality\nThis action \"automatically crawls and indexes repository documentation on DeepWiki,\" making project documentation searchable and accessible through concurrent processing with configurable retry logic.\n\n## Input Parameters\n\n| Input | Description | Required | Default |\n|-------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| `repository` | Identifier in owner/repo format, GitHub URL, or DeepWiki URL | No | `${{ github.repository }}` |\n| `max_concurrency` | Number of concurrent crawl workers | No | `3` |\n| `request_timeout` | HTTP request timeout in milliseconds | No | `30000` |\n| `retry_attempts` | Number of retry attempts for failed requests | No | `3` |\n\n## Output Parameters\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `repo_exists` | Boolean indicating if repository exists on DeepWiki |\n| `org_repo` | Extracted org/repo identifier |\n| `deepwiki_url` | Generated DeepWiki URL for the repository |\n\n## Example Workflow YAML\n\n```yaml\nname: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\njobs:\n  crawl-deepwiki:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        \n      - name: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n        uses: erayack/deepwiki-action@v1\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ github.repository }}\n          max_concurrency: '3'\n          request_timeout: '30000'\n          retry_attempts: '3'\n```\n\n## Using Outputs\n\n```yaml\n- name: Crawl DeepWiki Documentation\n  id: deepwiki\n  uses: erayack/deepwiki-action@v1\n\n- name: Check results\n  run: |\n    echo \"Repository exists: ${{ steps.deepwiki.outputs.repo_exists }}\"\n    echo \"DeepWiki URL: ${{ steps.deepwiki.outputs.deepwiki_url }}\"\n```\n\n## Optional Configuration\nSet repository variables for environment-level customization:\n- `MAX_CONCURRENCY` (default: 3)\n- `REQUEST_TIMEOUT` (default: 30000)\n- `RETRY_ATTEMPTS` (default: 3)\n\n## Output Artifacts\n- `deepwiki-content.md` - Raw markdown documentation\n- `index.html` - Formatted HTML documentation with styling","durationMs":8224,"url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/deepwiki-documentation-crawler"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f5ec9c48-ccab-4095-a508-b996751aced6"}
